  That is the SECOND consecutive close it has run on. It missed three closes
  before the milestone-close wiring went live with the conductor restart.
- qa_layer_authenticity_audit_report.md reports "Scanned 4 of 20" and the
  rotation state advanced 5 -> 9 of 176 units. Before the timeout fix
